From c46d8a91b007348a6a5cd8f98f26bd520c9d8a70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sureshkumar <suresure@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Jan 2026 20:44:46 +0530
Subject: [PATCH]  Implement Multi-AP Client Association Control Request
 (0x8016) handling  to allow blocking/unblocking client STAs from associating
 with specific BSSIDs.

 Changes:
    - Add BML API for client association control
    - Implement agent-side handling for allow/disallow requests
    - Add CLI command for testing
    - Support timed and indefinite blocking modes

Signed-off-by: Sureshkumar <suresure@qti.qualcomm.com>
